# Cosmic stage 2 with Geant4 secondary splitting, main stream: every knock-on electron and bremsstrahlung
# photon of a muon in DS2Vacuum is made CosmicSplitFactor (100) times, in the tracker
# CosmicSplitTrackerFactor (10) times and in the inner cryostat wall CosmicSplitWallFactor (10) times, each
# copy with weight 1/factor. The alternatives share one event, so run S2FamilySplit.fcl on the output
# before digitization: it puts each split family in its own event and attaches the weights (EventWeight
# "FamilySplit"). It also drops the events whose muon decays in flight within CosmicSplitDecayWindow:
# those come from the decay stream, S2ResamplerSplitDecay.fcl, which must be run too.
# Gammas, e+- and neutrons below 80 MeV are killed at birth (CosmicSplit.softKillCut), so only the copies
# that can matter for a conversion-like track are tracked.
# Needs Offline with physics.secondaryBiasing (Mu2eG4) and FamilySplitSource (Sources).
# Yuri Oksuzian, 2026
#include "Production/JobConfig/cosmic/S2Resampler.fcl"
physics.producers.g4run.Mu2eG4CommonCut : @local::CosmicSplit.softKillCut
physics.producers.g4run.physics.minRangeCut : @local::CosmicSplit.minRangeCut
physics.producers.g4run.physics.minRangeRegionCuts : @local::CosmicSplit.regionCuts
physics.producers.g4run.physics.secondaryBiasing : @local::CosmicSplit.G4
